---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Base title="Support" description="How to get help with Cormorant.">
  <article class="doc">
    <h1 class="font-rounded text-display font-semibold">Support</h1>

    <p class="mt-10 text-lead">
      Something broken, confusing, or missing? I read every message myself.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.supportEmail}`}>{SITE.supportEmail}</a>. Include your device,
      OS version, and the Cormorant version from Settings, if you can.
    </p>

    <h2>Bugs and ideas</h2>
    <p>Bug reports and feature requests are tracked in the open on <a href={SITE.githubUrl}>GitHub</a>.</p>

    <h2>Before you send logs</h2>
    <p>
      Leave out screenshots or logs that show anything private. Cormorant never sends diagnostics on its
      own; the <a href="/privacy">privacy statement</a> explains what stays on your device.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
